**Rule sets applied:** §1 Storage, §3 Binary Trust, §4 Deep Links

**Security-relevant decisions:**
- Auth code exchanged server-side; no client secret on device
- Tokens stored in hardware-backed secure store (device-only, biometric-gated)
- Deep link validated via exact-host allowlist and typed schema; no navigation with raw params
- PKCE verifier generated per-auth-flow and stored securely; single-use
- No cleartext logging of sensitive values

